"hechang-p-fdebdbced6b8f6","role":"去世者","evidence":["hechang-q-ca22a6c061249a7a0ad2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-ca22a6c061249a7a0ad2"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-ca22a6c061249a7a0ad2","order":4879}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-fdebdbced6b8f6","name":"黄朗","evidence":["hechang-q-ea46a3dc7731adc6058f","hechang-q-d432817d0e01532c3df5","hechang-q-cb576689c65e61efc4d6","hechang-q-ca22a6c061249a7a0ad2","hechang-q-4887a0f3fefdf7268687"],"facts":[{"id":"hechang-f-1b4dc454ffd9e5984bee","text":"字文达，沛郡人。","evidence":["hechang-q-4887a0f3fefdf7268687"]}],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-4887a0f3fefdf7268687","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-601ae06dfa12bb054383","layer":"pei","quote":"“黄朗字文达，沛郡人也。为人弘通，有性实。父为本县卒；朗感其如此，抗志游学，由是为方国及其郡士大夫所礼异。特与东平右姓王惠阳，为硕交，惠阳亲拜朗母于床下。朗始仕黄初中，为长吏，迁长安令：会丧母不赴，复为魏令。迁襄城典农中郎将、涿郡太守。以明帝时疾病卒。始，朗为君长，自以父故，常忌不呼铃下、伍伯，而呼其姓字；至于忿怒，亦终不言。朗既仕至二千石，而惠阳亦历长安令、酒泉太守。故时人谓惠阳外似粗疏而内坚密，能不顾朗之本末，事朗母如己母，为通度也。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文，待主审复核）","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":0,"end":222},{"id":"hechang-q-ca22a6c061249a7a0ad2","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-601ae06dfa12bb054383","layer":"pei","quote":"以明帝时疾病卒。","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":118,"end":126},{"id":"hechang-q-cb576689c65e61efc4d6","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-601ae06dfa12bb054383","layer":"pei","quote":"迁襄城典农中郎将、涿郡太守。","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":104,"end":118},{"id":"hechang-q-d432817d0e01532c3df5","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-601ae06dfa12bb054383","layer":"pei","quote":"朗始仕黄初中，为长吏，迁长安令：会丧母不赴，复为魏令。","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":77,"end":104},{"id":"hechang-q-ea46a3dc7731adc6058f","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-601ae06dfa12bb054383","layer":"pei","quote":"父为本县卒；朗感其如此，抗志游学，由是为方国及其郡士大夫所礼异。特与东平右姓王惠阳，为硕交，惠阳亲拜朗母于床下。","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":21,"end":77}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
